    "body": "Thanks again @zcorpan. I've added the comma back but I believe it's grammatically wrong to add it there.\r\n\r\nAlso on \"elements\" I added \"other elements\", maybe not for a great reason other than the wording read awkwardly without it. I tried a variant with \"to contain elements as its children\" or \"to contain formatting elements\" and \"to contain elements as child nodes.\" Something seems missing, and maybe it's the whole sentence that could be reworeded more naturally. 🤷‍♂️ \r\n\r\nI appreciate all your help and am happy to continue revising this until everyone is happy with it.",
